  "description": "When Yuri Gable first pulled the young Ling Xinlu out from the ocean, he didn’t expect the two of them to ever meet again, especially not at gunpoint. Danger always seems to follow their encounters, though it isn’t until Xinlu messes with the wrong psycho and loses both his first love and an eye that the two men finally find the chance to open up to each other. But how will their relationship progress when Xinlu has no memory of Yuri saving him before and only recalls a man who seemingly left him for dead underwater?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
